 "notes": "Polk/Klipsch SKU lists trimmed (Polk XT15, R100, ES15, XT70, Klipsch RP-5000F II, RP-8060FA II dropped as near-duplicates); subwoofers trimmed from 19 to 12 (dropped B&W ASW608/DB2D, Cambridge MINX X201/MSX SUB 200/300, Klipsch Flexus Sub 100, Denon Home Subwoofer). Brief items not attested on any retrieved page and so left out: Harbeth P3/Compact 7/M30/M40, Wharfedale Denton/Linton, Tannoy Westminster/Autograph (Tannoy page names only Prestige), Sonus faber Electa Amator/Guarneri, Dynaudio models, B&W 600 series and 800 D4, JBL L100 Century/Classic, Avantgarde years (no dated page). LS3/5A has no single maker so mk is empty and licensees are versions. Tannoy dual-concentric placed under Floor-standing rather than Horn."
